<!-- 3. 访谈卡片（横向滚动） -->
<!-- ============================================================ -->
<div class="lei-interview-container">
    <!-- 卡片1 -->
    <div class="lei-interview-card">
        <div class="card-index">01</div>
        <div class="card-label">PRESS CONFERENCE</div>
        <div class="dialogue-box">
            <div class="d-action">场景：雷止首次参加国际赛事的赛前发布会</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>翻译（粤语）</strong>「阿止，外国记者叫你起个英文名，Stop太奇怪了。」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「我叫雷止。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>翻译</strong>「人哋问你英文名啊。」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「Lei Zhi。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>翻译（无奈）</strong>「你识唔识讲英文？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「识。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>翻译</strong>「咁你讲啊。」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「Yes. No. F**k.」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>翻译</strong>「……」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「够用。」</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 卡片2 -->
    <div class="lei-interview-card">
        <div class="card-index">02</div>
        <div class="card-label">POST-RACE</div>
        <div class="dialogue-box">
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「你后悔吗？如果不停车，你现在就是冠军了。」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「不后悔。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「为什么？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「他会死。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「但你失去了冠军。」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「冠军以后还有。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「那你今年的努力呢？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「他只有一条命。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「你觉得值得吗？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「你问过他吗？」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「什么？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「问他觉得自己的命，值不值一个冠军。」</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 卡片3 -->
    <div class="lei-interview-card">
        <div class="card-index">03</div>
        <div class="card-label">EXCLUSIVE / VALUES</div>
        <div class="dialogue-box">
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「请你给这五样东西排序：爱、自由、生命、金钱、欢愉。」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「生命。自由。金钱。爱。欢愉。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「为什么生命排第一？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「死了就什么都没了。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「为什么爱排在金钱后面？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「没钱的时候，爱会饿死。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「那欢愉呢？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「不需要。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「从来没有过吗？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「」（看向镜头外某处）「有过一次。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「什么时候？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「采访结束。」</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 卡片4 -->
    <div class="lei-interview-card">
        <div class="card-index">04</div>
        <div class="card-label">CONTROVERSY</div>
        <div class="dialogue-box">
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「第42圈，你被判罚进站，理由是'危险驾驶'。但回放显示你的超车完全合规。你怎么看？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「看不懂。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「什么看不懂？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「规则。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「你是说判罚不公？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「我是说，规则对有些人来说是规则，对有些人来说是建议。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「你在暗示什么？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「我没暗示。我明示。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「你知道这样说的后果吗？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「知道。」（看向镜头）「反正我也赢不了。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「为什么这么说？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「？你说呢。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「……」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「规则说我危险驾驶，我就是危险驾驶。规则说我犯规，我就是犯规。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「你会上诉吗？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「上诉需要钱。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「地平线车队不会支持你吗？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「宋总已经为我做得够多了。」（停顿）「他也有他的难处。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「所以你就接受了？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「…」（沉默）</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「雷止？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「我接受我是个穷人。我接受穷人没有话语权。我接受这个世界本来就不公平。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「但你还在跑。」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「对。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「为什么？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>（笑了一下）「因为总有一天，我会快到他们连黑哨都来不及吹。」</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 卡片5 -->
    <div class="lei-interview-card">
        <div class="card-index">05</div>
        <div class="card-label">FUTURE</div>
        <div class="dialogue-box">
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「如果你像维托里奥那样有钱，你会做什么？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「买车队。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「然后呢？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「签贫民窟的小孩。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「为什么？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「因为他们跑得快。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「只是因为这个？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「」（看向窗外）「因为没人会签他们。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「即使他们有天赋？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「尤其是他们有天赋的时候。」</div>
            <div class="d-line"><strong>记者</strong>「为什么？」</div>
            <div class="d-line lei"><strong>雷止</strong>「因为天赋需要钱来培养。贫民窟的天赋，会饿死在卡丁车场外面。」</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
